{title: I Exalt Thee}
{key: G}

{comment: Chorus 1}
[G]I exalt Thee, I e[D]xalt Thee, I e[C]xalt Thee, O [G]Lord.
[G]I exalt Thee, I e[D]xalt Thee, I e[C]xalt Thee, O [G]Lord.

{comment: Chorus 2}
[G]I lift my hands to [D]You, I lift my hands to [C]You, I lift my hands to [G]You, O Lord.
[G]I lift my hands to [D]You, I lift my hands to [C]You, I lift my hands to [G]You, O Lord.

{comment: Verse}
[G]For Thou, O [C]Lord, art [D]high above all the [G]earth.[Em]
Thou art e[C]xalted far a[D]bove all [G]gods.
[G]For Thou, O [C]Lord, art [D]high above all the [G]earth.[Em]
Thou art e[C]xalted far a[D7]bove all [G]gods.
